ble CCF and\nangina.\n\nMr. Zu also experienced an episode of exacerbation of his CCF          The next phase – could go with previous?\non 15th of January and consequently was treated with increased\ndose of the Lasix at 80 mg daily.\n\nOn review today, although his dyspnea has responded to Lasix,          On day of referral.\nthe patient reported a 10-minute- attack of angina (OR a 10-\nminute angina attack) yesterday. The ECG revealed suspicious\nanterolateral ischemic changes.\n\nGiven Mr. Zu’s history of acute myocardial infarction and the          Request for help + offer of further information.\natypical ischemic changes of his ECG, I would appreciate your\nfurther assessment and management regarding his angina.\nPlease do not hesitate to contact me if you require further\ninformation.\n\nYours sincerely\n\nXXXXXXX\n\n(words 205)", "extraction": "text"}, {"number": 140, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 141, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 142, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 143, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 144, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 145, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 146, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 147, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 148, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 149, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 150, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 151, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 152, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 153, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 154, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 155, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 156, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 157, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 158, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 159, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 160, "text": "A to Z of Phrasal Verbs and Useful Vocabulary\n Letter                   Expressi