             Commented [ESL2]: urgent management\n\n\n Regarding her history, Kathy suffers from intermittent asthma since 2014, underwent an appendectomy        Commented [ESL3]: (Sequence the information\nten years ago, and had pelvic inflammatory disease in 2013. Furthermore, her first pregnancy ended in       logically based on importance.)\nmiscarriage at 12 weeks in 2019 due to pre-eclampsia, and she was diagnosed with antiphospholipid           (Miscarriage and then the remaining medical history)\nsyndrome three months later. Please note, she is allergic to dusts, pollen and penicillin, she smokes ten   (Try to write social and family history n this case in a\ncigarettes per day, and she consumes alcohol and crack occasionally. Her family history is positive for     separate paragraph to give importance to medical\n                                                                                                            information and for clarity.)\ndiabetes, hypertension and pancreatic cancer. Lastly, she was prescribed Aspirin 100 mg per day since her\nfifth week of pregnancy; however, she was not consistent with her follow-up appointments.                   Commented [ESL4]: Mrs Shawn\n                                                                                                            (Use last name/surname with appropriate title when\n                                                                                                            referring to an adult in body paragraphs.)\n Today, Kathy presented with dizziness, headache, nausea, vomiting, blurred vision, abdominal pain and\n                                                                                                            Commented [ESL5]: (The following\nvaginal spotting for 24 hours. On examination, her blood pressure was 152/90, pulse was 90 and              connectors/linking words are not accepted in OET\nrespiratory rate was 22. Moreover, bilateral pitting pedal edema, peri-orobital edema, facial puffiness,    writing: so, because, moreover, meanwhile, besides,\ntenderness in the right upper abdomen and confusion were noted. Finally, fetal position was oblique with    furthermore, thus, hence, thereafter, apart from\n                                                                                                            this/that and later on)\nfaint heart sounds.\n                                                                                                            https://edubenchmark.com/blog/list-of-linking-\nBased on the above data, urgent referral of Kathy is needed to control of her blood pressure and close      connectors-to-avoid-in-oet-letter-writing/\nmonitoring to prevent development of eclampsia.\n                                                                                                            Commented [ESL6]: and\n\nShould you have any queries, please do not hesitate to contact me.                                          Commented [ESL7]: Please note\n                                                                                                            Commented [ESL8]: a\nYours faithfully,                                                                                           Brand: Upper Case (first letter)\n                                                                                                            Generic: Lower Case (first letter)\nDoctor\n                                                                                                            https://edubenchmark.com/blog/oet-writing-tips-\n                                                                                                            capital-letters/\n\n                                                    Report                                                  Commented [ESL9]: during\n     Word Length               210                                                                          Commented [ESL1