.       Comment [OET8]: C\nThis is her seventh hospital admission since her diagnosis with schizophrenia back in 2015.\n                                                                                                              Comment [OET9]: ; the next one is due\n                                                                                                              Comment [OET10]: already known to\nBased on the above, Mrs. Grace would need rehabilitation, psychosocial skills training, and ensuring her      the addressee\ncompliance with treatment. Should you have any queries, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n                                                                                                              Comment [OET11]: encouragement to\n                                                                                                              comply\nYours sincerely,\nDoctor\n\n\n\n                                                     Report\n    Word Length                 166\n    Comments                    The letter is much shorter than the minimum 180 words and needs\n                                more information on hospitalisation. Also, many inaccuracies\n                                pertaining to grammar and word choice are visible. The letter does\n                                not meet the expectations.\n    Estimated Grade             C+\n    Estimated Score             330/500\n    Advice                      1. Always read and select case notes carefully.\n                                2. Avoid basic grammar errors.\n                                3. Punctuate the content appropriately.\n                                4. Pay attention to spelling and capitalization.\n                                5. Improve choice of words.\n                                6. Try to write at least 180 words.\n                                7. Always proofread the letter after finishing it.\n\n    Free Resources           