/settings.xmlPK\ng � word/document.xmlPK  G JL����, A word/_rels/document.xml.relsPK     G JL-\nh�\"�* | _rels/.relsPK   G JL!Z��, � f word/theme/theme1.xmlPK       G JL3� �, - � [Content_Types].xmlPK B B", "extraction": "text"}, {"number": 616, "text": "OET STUDY PLAN\n\n\nTarget Score: B\nFocus Areas: Speaking,Writing\nLength of Preparation:\n\n\n\nWHAT YOU NEED TO DO\n  1. Understand the OET “tasks”\n           OET Writing\n           OET Speaking\n           OET Listening Part A\n           OET Listening Part B\n           OET Reading Part A\n           OET Reading Part B\n\n\n  2. Learn the OET “methods”\n     Click OET > Task > Method\n           OET Writing\n           OET Speaking\n           OET Listening Part A\n           OET Listening Part B\n           OET Reading Part A\n           OET Reading Part B\n\n\n  3. Practice the OET “lessons”\n           OET Writing\n           OET Speaking\n           OET Listening Part A\n           OET Listening Part B\n           OET Reading Part A\n           OET Reading Part B\n\n\n  4. Complete the OET “sub-test”\n           OET Writing sub-test\n           OET Listening Part A sub-test\n           OET Listening Part B sub-test", "extraction": "text"}, {"number": 617, "text": "OET Reading Part A sub-test\n        OET Reading Part B sub-test\n\n\n\n\nENABLING SKILL BUILDING\n   Build vocabulary\n        Click here to watch core vocab lessons\n   Improve grammar\n        Click here to watch core grammar lessons\n   Refine pronunciation\n        Click here to watch core pronunciation lessons", "extraction": "text"}, {"number": 618, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 619, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 620, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 621, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 622, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 623, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 624, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 625, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 626, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 627, "text": "", "extraction": "none"}, {"number": 628, "text": "Occupational English Test\n\n                                       WRITING SUB-TEST\n                                                                      Medicine\n                                                                         Practice test\n\n\n\n\nPlease print in BLOCK LETTERS\n\n\n      Candidate number                            –               –\n\n\n\n              Family name\n\n\n            Other name(s)\n\n\n                         City\n\n\n               Date of test\n\n\n   Candidate’s signature\n\n\n\n              YOU MUST NOT REMOVE OET MATERIAL FROM THE TEST ROOM.\n\n\n\n\nThe OET Centre                  Telephone: +613 9652 0800\nGPO Box 372                     Facsimile: +613 9654 5329\nMelbourne VIC 3001              www.occupationalenglishtest.org\nAustralia\n\n© OET Centre — Practice test                                                ABN 84 434 201 642", "extraction": "text"}, {"number": 629, "text": "OCCUPATIONAL ENGLISH TEST\nWRITING SUB-TEST:                     MEDICINE\nTIME ALLOWED:                         READING TIME:                  5 MINUTES\n                                      WRITING TIME:                  40 MINUTES\n\nRead the case notes and complete the writing task which follows.\n\n\nNotes:\n\nPatient:            Anne Hall (Ms)\n\nDOB:                19.9.1965\n\n                    Height: 163cm Weight: 75kg BMI: 28.2 (18/6/10)\n\n\nSocial History:     Teacher (Secondary – History, English)\n\n                    Divorced, 2 children at home (born 1994, 1996)\n\n                    Non-smoker (since children born)\n\n                    Social drinker – mainly spirits\n\nSubstance Intake:   Nil\n\nAllergies:          Codeine; dust mites; sulphur dioxide\n\nFHx:                Mother – hypertension; asthmatic; Father – peptic ulcer\n\n                    Maternal grandmother – died heart attack, aged 80\n\n                    Maternal grandfather – died asthma attack\n\n                    Paternal grandmother – unknown\n\n                    Paternal grandfather – died ‘old age’ 94\n\n\n\nPMHx:               Childhood asthma; chickenpox; measles\n\n                    1975 tonsillectomy\n\n                    1982 hepatitis A (whole family infected)\n\n                    1984 sebaceous cyst removed\n\n                    1987 whiplash injury\n\n                    1998 depression (separation from husband); SSRI – fluoxetine 11/12\n\n                    2000 overweight – sought weight reduction\n\n\n\n\nTURN OVER                                                                                2", "extraction": "text", "display": {"version": 2, "text": "OCCUPATIONAL ENGLISH TEST\n\nWRITING SUB-TEST:\n\nMEDICINE\n\nTIME ALLOWED:\n\nREADING TIME:\n\n5 MINUTES\n\nWRITING TIME:\n\n40 MINUTES\n\nRead the case notes and complete the writing task which follows.\n\nNotes:\n\nPatient:\n\nAnne Hall (Ms)\n\nDOB:\n\n19.9.1965\n\nHeight: 163cm Weight: 75kg BMI: 28.2 (18/6/10)\n\nSocial History:\n\nTeacher (Secondary – History, English)\n\nDivorced, 2 children at home (born 1994, 1996)\n\nNon-smoker (since children born)\n\nSocial drinker – mainly spirits\n\nSubstance Intake:\n\nNil\n\nAllergies:\n\nCodeine; dust mites; sulphur dioxide\n\nFHx:\n\nMother – hypertension; asthmatic; Father – peptic ulcer\n\nMaternal grandmother – died heart attack, aged 80\n\nMaternal grandfather – died asthma attack\n\nPaternal grandmother – unknown\n\nPaternal grandfather – died ‘old age’ 94\n\nPMHx:\n\nChildhood asthma; chickenpox; measles\n\n1975 tonsillectomy\n\n1982 hepatitis A (whole family infected)\n\n1984 sebaceous cyst removed\n\n1987 whiplash injury\n\n1998 depression (separation from husband); SSRI – fluoxetine 11/12\n\n2000 overweight – sought weight reduction\n\nTURN OVER\n\n2", "layout": {"version": 1, "width": 595.276, "height": 841.89, "blocks": [{"text": "OCCUPATIONAL