: "WRITING Assessment Criteria and Level Descriptors (public version)\n\nBand\n\n•\n\n6\n\n•\n\n5\n\n•\n\n•\n\nMostly appropriate register,\ntone and lexis for the context.\nA few inaccuracies do not\nimpede communication.\nOrganisation is mostly clear,\nwith minor lapses in\nsequencing.\nGenerally appropriate\nregister, tone and lexis for the\ncontext, but errors are\nnoticeable.\nInappropriate organisation of\ninformation sometimes\ncauses strain.\n\n•\n\nFrequently inappropriate\nregister, tone and lexis for the\ncontext.\nPoor organisation of material\ncauses serious strain.\n\n•\n\n•\n\nAble to fulfil some task\nrequirements, but significantly\nlimited by frequent\nlapses/errors and/or restricted\nlinguistic resources.\nAnswer may be far too long\nor far too short.\n\n•\n\n•\n•\n\n•\n\nExtremely limited\ncommunication due to\nconstant errors and/or\nseverely restricted linguistic\nresources.\nVery brief/significantly\nunfinished.\nAlmost non-existent.\n\n•\n\nCandidate does not provide any response.\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n2\n\n•\n\n© OET – 2018\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\nLinguistic Features\n(Grammar & Cohesion)\n\nComprehension of Stimulus\n\nEntirely appropriate register,\ntone and lexis for the content.\nMaterial is clearly and\nlogically organised.\n\nAble to manage the task, but\nrestricted in range and\nflexibility by lapses or errors.\nAnswer may be too long or\ntoo short.\n\n•\n\n3\n\n0\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n1\n\nAll aspects of the task\neffectively fulfilled.\n\nGenerally fulfils the task,\nthough occasional minor\nlapses/errors may indicate\nsome limitations.\nAnswer may be slightly too\nlong or too short.\n\n•\n\n4\n\nAppropriateness of\nLanguage\n\nOverall Task Fulfilment\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\nComplete understanding of\nstimulus material and task\ninstructions.\nSelects all relevant material\nfrom the stimulus notes.\nAlmost complete\nunderstanding of stimulus\nmaterial and task instructions.\nOccasional omissions or\nirrelevancies do not impede\ncommunication.\n\n•\n\nGenerally accurate\nunderstanding of stimulus\nmaterial and task instructions.\nOmissions or irrelevancies\nare noticeable (i.e. includes\ntoo little or too much\ninformation).\n\n•\n\nBasic errors in\ncomprehension of stimulus\nmaterial and task instructions.\nFrequent inaccuracies and/or\ninappropriate selection of\nmaterial.\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\nOften unintelligible.\nNo evidence of organisation.\n\n•\n\nAlmost entirely\nmisunderstands task and\nstimulus material.\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\nAlmost unintelligible.\n\n•\n\nNo evidence of understanding\ntask or stimulus material.\n\n•\n\nWide range of grammatical\nstructures used accurately\nand flexibly.\nFluent linking of ideas by\nappropriate cohesive devices.\nMostly accurate use of a\nrange of grammatical\nstructures.\nGenerally appropriate use of\ncohesive devices.\nOccasional errors are not\nintrusive.\nUses a fair range of\ngrammatical structures.\nErrors are noticeable and at\ntimes reflect limited\ngrammatical resources.\nInappropriate or insufficient\ncohesive devices sometimes\ncause strain.\nLimited range of grammatical\nstructures.\nErrors are frequent and\nintrusive, reflecting\ninadequate resources of\ngrammar.\nMinimal or inappropriate use\nof cohesive devices.\nVery limited grammatical\nresources, even in simple\nsentences.\nNo attempt to use cohesive\ndevices.\n\nImpossible to follow,\nconsisting of strings or\nisolated words and phrases.\n\nPresentation Features\n(Spelling, Punctuation &\nLayout)\n• High level of accuracy in\nspelling and punctuation.\n• Layout of letter is appropriate.\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\n•\n\nMostly accurate spelling and\npunctuation.\nOccasional errors are not\nintrusive.\nLayout of letter is appropriate.\n\nInaccuracies in spelling and\npunctuation are sometimes\nintrusive.\nLayout of letter is mostly\nappropriate.\n\nLimited control of spelling and\npunctuation.\nFrequent inaccuracies are\nintrusive.\nLayout of letter may be\ninappropriate.\n\nVery limited control of spelling\nand punctuation.\nLayout of letter is\ninappropriate.\n\nLimited in all respects.", "layout": {"version": 1, "width": 841.92, "height": 595.32, "blocks": [{"text": "WRITING Assessment Criteria and Level Descriptors (public version)", "lines": [{"text": "WRITING Assessment Criteria and Level Descriptors (public version)", "x": 0.09478335233751425, "y": 0.06037089296512799, "width": 0.46670705055112127, "height": 0.022515621850433383, "confidence": 1, "words": [{"text": "WRITING", "x": 0.09478335233751425, "width": 0.06183010262257697, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "Assessment", "x": 0.1607991258076777, "width": 0.08365165336374002, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "Criteria", "x": 0.2483561383504371, "width": 0.0499714937286203, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "and", "x": 0.30233276320790575, "width": 0.025413340935005687, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "Level", "x": 0.3317084758646902, "width": 0.036145952109464106, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "Descriptors", "x": 0.3718595591030027, "width": 0.07931870011402506, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "(public", "x": 0.4554470733561384, "width": 0.04655074116305588, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "version)", "x": 0.5060029456480426, "width": 0.055487457240592945, "confidence": 1}]}]}, {"text": "Band", "lines": [{"text": "Band", "x": 0.03477765108323832, "y": 0.1306292414163811, "width": 0.029575256556442418, "height": 0.01868796613585971, "confidence": 1, "words": [{"text": "Band", "x": 0.03477765108323832, "width": 0.029575256556442418, "confidence": 1}]}]}, {"text": "•", "lines": [{"text": "•", "x": 0.07839224629418473, "y": 0.1694762480682658, "width": 0.00517958950969213, "height": 0.019507155815359806, "confidence": 1, "words": [{"text": "•", "x": 0.07839224629418473, "width": 0.00517958950969213, "confidence": 1}]}]}, {"text": "6", "lines": [{"text": "6", "x": 0.04489737742303307, "y": 0.20364476248068264, "width": 0.009271949828962376, "height": 0.02634327756500706, "confidence